{"type":"message","id":"f0443871","parentId":"b8f83b6b","timestamp":"2026-03-14T21:01:21.295Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Clarifying Telegram Sync Issues**\n\nI need to create a summary in plain text. It sounds like Telegram is enabled, but if the group allowlist is empty, that means group messages might not be fully synced. I should mention this potential issue in the summary, as it could affect communication. Let’s make sure to clarify that messages could be missed due to this setting and keep the wording clear and straightforward for everyone involved!","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_04a3e9ad89d67b860169b5cc9ac0948191b3333f44c2fd6e50\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABptcydjTnrKpeZx0YOth_iHis-aB2JisHm5x3sPrViLvUytbTRIQoaZeiq3Nl81DPaTyHbCdayRj4sFZUy5UAJ8UwfqDIWk55CvqXzT8vC_6TTMO8PqR-1FDzI5aNQEFxIlEX5ZlyHJCipCm3K932wxzH-BJDzMD9O0IcqOfpufvHeA_DMx6zONYvAO7FxEC1Wb4aCUUWsJLWddqfJJseqTuLzc1e6fd9sQ7r3Oq51AKV8OxVDhrA_7vOQE29tvpein6L4pqkz7ZAYHuxdhfOMzMypWqghxuxidBMaR8CAjWHfewPISWiBqjY_-r8Y8VsVaoFhjIydteAgKCrklclt8Ee0FEw76Bs41OZRpufTYdUp0YE5KR58v70vs22JbYr2lm9cFBRFbkW8YB5oL-R7gqcAgUFDFQv4MCeuM18h7T1rOchS0t4XHHsa3w-vC_CElCAoy_aAwGiZzucN1eGeo9JbRnPbD9QUYGr6Dj8Bwb-cf0IJlfVJonYcEZ01hvuMar1mE83Vl6MGQpZ_HqLSHZXjAjwbvOInB4dBxam-izVAvFi6msLhna2vAUf4vdlFYsUmyMUl2H3qd_LpkL3f3OREzmNW5M9SPf8Bkqhkf7OiSh_wX_aqE9LzEdICFUupbXLdb3MlbJkmqewNPp8EMWhoyWVfIAZDtcg5eNAzI_rHBCuwyF4KuOrG3YlO26hiKqg8x-heItBjypKxWgBmzBuYIo8zg4CRmGWYPJzWWiORpY-RfTBghj9wchBW-aW2pGgXqBexd9yz1qLqcGa-I_ep-jHL_EgVdKsgbC1j10cZsTBB_yvlD-AubX2IKeVYO6GcnhYu45FOCxbF3LUS0Dl2vhreOb7U9MgKhP6eUnN65efUxZ9aMTPP-udpxfHyoTuS0p-T8EzGMaJIrlQdsgJeQSX7aim15FTiamZDDx_PHetw-rsvAgrizsS7PIOB6Oz7z6CVyJRRtlUSC_fGz2YPPrrruBnOplYe1W1FaQlOfX1jUJcqTFDlLRX07w5hwdsTsCDI1gCJC8cFtx_KsapavQ==\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Clarifying Telegram Sync Issues**\\n\\nI need to create a summary in plain text. It sounds like Telegram is enabled, but if the group allowlist is empty, that means group messages might not be fully synced. I should mention this potential issue in the summary, as it could affect communication. Let’s make sure to clarify that messages could be missed due to this setting and keep the wording clear and straightforward for everyone involved!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"업데이트 점검 결과:\n\n1) OpenClaw\n- 설치 방식: pnpm\n- 업데이트 채널: stable\n- 사용 가능 업데이트 있음: npm latest 2026.3.13\n- 현재 설정 메타 기준 lastTouchedVersion: 2026.3.12\n\n2) Skills\n- `npx skills check` 결과: 자동 확인 가능한 skill은 모두 최신 상태\n- 다만 77개 skill은 version hash가 없어 자동 업데이트 여부를 판별할 수 없음\n- 즉, “업데이트 필요”로 검출된 skill은 없었고, “자동 확인 불가” 항목만 다수 존재\n\n3) Telegram 채널 동기화 확인\n- 설정상 Telegram 채널은 활성화되어 있음:\n  - `channels.telegram.enabled = true`\n  - Telegram plugin enabled\n  - `sendMessage/reactions/sticker` 활성화\n- 다만 상태 경고 1건 확인:\n  - `groupPolicy = allowlist` 인데 `groupAllowFrom` / `allowFrom` 이 비어 있어\n  - 그룹 메시지는 현재 모두 자동 드롭될 가능성이 있음\n- 따라서 DM/페어링 기반 동작은 설정상 살아 있으나, 그룹 채널 기준으로는 “완전 정상”이라고 보기 어렵고 allowlist 동기화/정합성 점검이 필요함\n\n권고:\n- OpenClaw는 2026.3.13으로 업데이트 검토\n- Telegram을 그룹에서도 정상 수신해야 한다면 `channels.telegram.groupAllowFrom` 또는 `allowFrom` 설정 필요\n- Skills는 즉시 업데이트 대상은 없지만, 자동 확인 불가 skill들은 필요 시 각 원본 저장소 기준으로 별도 갱신 정책을 잡는 것이 좋음","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_04a3e9ad89d67b860169b5cc9da4e48191914e993a7bdfe181\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":7099,"output":406,"cacheRead":24192,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":31697,"cost":{"input":0.017747500000000003,"output":0.00609,"cacheRead":0.0060479999999999996,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.029885500000000002}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773522073200}}
